File Name: events_screen.dart

1. Modification Done:

   * Created a placeholder Events page for Phase 1 navigation.
   * Added page header with title and description.
   * Shows sample content for “2nd KMC Alumni Meet” (date and venue from handbook).
   * Notes that the full events list will connect to the API in Phase 3.

2. Purpose of This Modification:

   * Phase 1 requires all public nav links to render a real page, even if full API integration comes later.
   * Gives testers a destination when clicking “Events” in the menu.

3. How This Modification Is Involved in the Flow:

   * Registered at `/events` in `app_router.dart`.
   * Linked from header navigation, mobile drawer, and footer.
   * Will be replaced or extended in Phase 3 with live data from backend events APIs.
